<section class="card card-body"><h2>AI reading</h2><p><%= aiUsage.today.calls %> reads today · <%= Number(aiUsage.today.tokens/1000).toLocaleString('en-US') %>k of <%= (aiUsage.today.allowance/1000000).toFixed(1) %>M tokens in the local service limit.</p><p>Lookups StockChief does in code cost nothing and are not counted.</p><ul><% for(const purpose of aiUsage.purposes){ %><li><%= purpose.label %>: <%= purpose.calls %> reads</li><% } %></ul></section>
